Gittan's licenses
=================

Gittan is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3
(LICENSE.gittan). That covers Gittan itself and tqshim, the bridge between
Gittan and its JavaScript engine. Gittan's source, with every package below,
is at https://github.com/slicke/gittan.

tqshim (Trndi-QuickJS) and the extensions engine around it come from Trndi,
Copyright (c) Björn Lindh, also under the GNU General Public License,
version 3: https://github.com/slicke/trndi

The other files beside it, and the code built into it, come from elsewhere
under licenses of their own, which cover that code only, not Gittan.


The JavaScript engine
---------------------

libqjs is quickjs-ng (https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs), the engine that
runs Gittan's extensions. It is under the MIT License, in LICENSE.quickjs-ng.


